// Zero-argument length readers, one per export group init_nodes/2/3
// creates: proving a reset actually emptied the list needs to see its
// length without indexing into it (indexing an empty list traps, and
// `then` cannot express "the call under test traps" for a check).
// parse/ast has no room for a sibling file, so store.id was promoted
// into its own subdirectory to make room for this one.

nk_len() {
  int n = len((import nk));
} return int n;
given kab_fixture ():(1)
given boot_a ():(0)

ns_len() {
  int n = len((import ns));
} return int n;
